<title>USA: Pakistan buys Australian/U.S. wheat for Feb -trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan buys Australian/U.S. wheat for Feb -trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan over the weekend bought a total of 315,000 tonnes wheat, 180,000 tonnes of which was Australian origin and 135,000 tonnes of which was U.S. wheat for February 1-28 delivery, several U.S. exporters said.  </p>
<p>One U.S. exporter said the deal included U.S. soft white wheat at about $152.00 a tonne, FOB, and Australian white milling wheat.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
